cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use ARGUS, please cite it with these metadata.
type: software
title: "ARGUS: Agentic Risk & Governance Unified Screening"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype for multi-agent KYC (know-your-customer) risk screening on synthetic
  data. Five agents run as one Microsoft Agent Framework workflow. Fixed rules compute the risk
  score and tier from typed findings, and a language model only writes the explanation for a
  human reviewer. ARGUS is not a compliance tool and makes no claim about real-world screening
  outcomes.
authors:
  - given-names: Arjun
    family-names: Ganesh
repository-code: "https://github.com/iarjunganesh/argus"
license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - KYC
  - AML
  - compliance
  - multi-agent systems
  - explainable AI
  - Microsoft Agent Framework
  - synthetic data
